<li><a href="https://open.substack.com/pub/edwardwu223235/p/academic-writing-shouldnt-be-a-solo?r=4dczl&amp;utm_medium=ios" rel="nofollow">Academic Writing Shouldn't Be a Solo Act</a> — full pipeline walkthrough (English)</li>
